  "context_policy": "Every field must be explicit; null means absence, never wildcard. Full ordered canonical active history is mandatory. Gates being true do not supply numeric q. No retries simulated by search. Shared preparation is one q event per distinct executed work identity; reuse is NO_NEW_Q_EVENT. Different auth/resource contexts do not deduplicate.",
  "interval_semantics": "q_i = P(E_i completes under the declared execution policy | foothold, scenario, and all previous active events succeeded). Exact rational epistemic scenario bounds, not statistical confidence intervals. P(path) multiplies all ordered conditional bounds without an independence assumption. Any missing bound makes P(path) null.",
